{
  "_doc": [
    "Team badges for the site (components/f1.tsx TeamBadge) and the dashboard (modules/teams.py). A team is found by",
    "its name (lower case, accents stripped; then the chassis part before '-', so 'Lotus-Climax' is Lotus), first entry",
    "that lists it and whose 'years' hold the season. A logo shows for seasons in its since/until; otherwise the badge is",
    "the team colour with 'short' (or letters from the name). Logos are freely licensed files from Wikimedia Commons:",
    "'source' is the file's title there; scripts/fetch_team_logos.py downloads them to web/public/logos/ and fills in",
    "licence, author and url. Add a logo by adding its source and file, then run that script. A logo with no 'source'",
    "was supplied by hand (Ferrari, Racing Bulls, Toro Rosso, ...): its original is kept in 'archive' (archive/logos/), which the script copies",
    "back if the file is missing. Teams with no logo keep the badge. A hand-supplied logo's 'page' is the URL it came from; one that was cropped or converted has the download as is in archive/logos/original/."
  ],
